# Scriptoribus CODEOWNERS
# Automatically request review from the maintainer for certain changes.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default: maintainer owns everything
* @mitchopt

# Explicit: critical paths that always need maintainer review
/.github/       @mitchopt
/scripts/       @mitchopt
/js/            @mitchopt
/css/           @mitchopt
/tests/         @mitchopt
/*.html         @mitchopt
/package.json   @mitchopt

# Data-only files: contributors should only touch these
# (CODEOWNERS doesn't restrict, but makes it visible if someone edits code by mistake)
/data/raw_md/*.md
/data/images/manifest.json
